ga7l(){return"You value your individuality but don't constantly seek the spotlight. You use 'Personal Influence' selectively, when you feel it's truly important, but at other times, you prefer to act through other strategies."},
gaB6(){return"'Personal Influence' is an important part of your life and a source of energy. You feel most alive when you can express your individuality, share your ideas, or lead others. Being noticed and influential is a significant need for you."},
gaB7(){return"The 'Personal Influence' strategy is not just a choice, but a fundamental need of your nature. To be the center, to shine, and to openly manifest your will is as natural to you as breathing. Any attempt to remain in the shadows leads to a loss of vital energy."},
ga7k(){return"You are capable of empathy, but your primary strategy is to create a reliable and predictable environment. You draw strength and a sense of security from stability, not from constant change. For you, flexibility is a tool, not an end in itself."},
gaB1(){return"The 'Empathy & Adaptability' strategy is your key talent. You trust your intuition to understand people and situations, finding the perfect balance between flexibility and creating a secure environment. The ability to feel and adapt is an important part of your success."},
gaB2(){return"The 'Empathy & Adaptability' strategy is your natural habitat. For you, living in the flow, intuitively reacting to change, and influencing through understanding others is as natural as breathing. Attempting to force yourself into rigid, inflexible frameworks leads to a loss of inner harmony."},
ga7j(){return"You value competence and are capable of seeing things through, but you don't turn every activity into a pursuit of a perfect result. For you, the process and personal involvement are often just as important as the final achievement."},
gaAY(){return"The 'Demonstration of Results' strategy is one of the main sources of your motivation. You gain deep satisfaction from honing your skills and creating a high-quality, finished product. Achieving mastery is an important life value for you."},
gaAZ(){return"The 'Demonstration of Results' strategy is a fundamental need of your nature. It is vital for you to bring what you start to perfection and be a recognized expert in what you do. A superficial approach or incompleteness causes you deep frustration."},
