gafc(){return"You have the potential for analysis and for building logical connections. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Mercury, is your tool for scanning reality and turning the chaos of facts into an orderly map. Although this is not a dominant trait, a conscious application of logic will help you learn effectively and convey your ideas clearly."},
gafd(){return"Your innate perceptiveness allows you to scan reality and find hidden connections that are unavailable to others. This key talent, synchronized with the cycle of Mercury, creates a constant need to ask deep questions and get to the heart of the matter. Trust your sharp intellect, it is your main ally in solving the most complex problems."},
gafm(){return"A mechanism for subjective assessment is built into your personality, which helps define your personal preferences. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Venus, serves as your tool for making personal decisions, from choosing a partner to making financial investments. Developing this inner 'compass' will allow you to more consciously shape your world according to your true desires."},
gafn(){return"Your powerful ability for subjective assessment unerringly determines what is valuable and attractive to you. This key talent, synchronized with the cycle of Venus, creates a strong need to build your life around your unique value system. Trust this inner 'compass', it accurately points to the sources of your personal resources and deep satisfaction."},
gafa(){return"You possess the energy for direct action and for defending your interests. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Mars, is your resource for overcoming obstacles and moving toward your goals. Although initiative is not always your primary strategy, in moments that require decisiveness, this energy will help you achieve what you desire."},
gafb(){return"Your powerful capacity for action is one of the main driving forces of your personality. This talent, synchronized with the cycle of Mars, creates a strong need for initiative, competition, and self-assertion. To feel fulfilled, you constantly need a worthy challenge to which you can direct your energy."},
gaf8(){return"You have the potential to synthesize information and see long-term perspectives. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Jupiter, is your instrument for strategic planning. Although it is not a dominant trait, tapping into this ability will help you choose the most promising directions for growth."},
gaf9(){return"Your powerful ability to synthesize allows you to see the bigger picture and find pathways for growth within it. This key talent, synchronized with the cycle of Jupiter, creates a strong need to expand your horizons and find your place of authority in society. Trust your vision, it unerringly leads you to success and self-realization."},
gafi(){return"You possess the resource to create order and work methodically on tasks. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Saturn, is your tool for achieving mastery through patience and discipline. Although a systematic approach may not always be your primary strategy, relying on it in key projects will ensure reliable and lasting results."},
gafj(){return"Your deep-seated need for order and predictability is one of the foundations of your personality. This key talent, synchronized with the cycle of Saturn, allows you to build strong structures and achieve mastery through persistent effort. Your strength is revealed when you act methodically, bringing what you start to perfection."},
gafk(){return"You have the capacity to generate original ideas and see alternative paths. This energy, synchronized with the cycle of Uranus, is your resource for updating outdated approaches at the right moment. Although you may not always seek change, using this gift will help you find unexpected and effective solutions."},
gafl(){return"Your innate drive for freedom and non-conformity is a key feature of your personality. This talent, synchronized with the cycle of Uranus, compels you to constantly question established rules and seek your own path. To realize your potential, you need a space for experimentation, free from the constraints of the past."},
gafe(){return"You have access to a subtle sensitivity to the moods and hidden meanings unfolding around you. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Neptune, is your inner 'barometer' for empathy and creativity. While you may not always rely on intuition, developing trust in it will grant you access to a deeper understanding of people and processes."},
gaff(){return"Your heightened intuition allows you to perceive collective moods and the 'spirit of the times' on a non-verbal level. This key talent, synchronized with the cycle of Neptune, creates a need to merge with something larger, be it art, spirituality, or service to an ideal. Your strength lies in the ability to feel what cannot be expressed in words."},
gafg(){return"You possess an inner 'radar' that alerts you to approaching crisis situations and deep-seated shifts in the collective field. This ability, synchronized with the cycle of Pluto, is your resource for survival and regeneration. Although you do not seek out crises, in pivotal moments this inner resilience will help you navigate trials and emerge renewed."},
gafh(){return"Your instinctive sensitivity to hidden processes and points of tension in the world is a key feature of your personality. This talent, synchronized with the cycle of Pluto, drives you to go deep and not fear topics that others avoid. Your power is unleashed when you fearlessly use the energy of a crisis for your own purification and transformation."},
