gaIM(){return"Turbulence zone. Events are shifting fast and unpredictably. Forget rigid plans: right now, success goes to those who can maneuver and change tactics on the fly."},
gW9(){return"The period carries more than one dynamics tone. Do not force it into a single mood: notice when the field supports flow, when it asks for adjustment, and when distance or structure becomes useful."},
