gaIG(){return"The field is quiet. The outside world isn't distracting or pressuring you. There is plenty of space to simply move at your own natural pace."},
gaID(){return"The field is responsive. Your environment is active enough and offers good support for your plans. A standard rhythm, well-suited for both work and connecting with others."},
