gaJg(){return"A calm background. The world isn't pressuring or rushing you. Use this extra space to move at your own pace and focus on what you want, rather than what's happening outside."},
gaJe(){return"A responsive background. Circumstances are lining up well to support your goals. A solid rhythm where the environment helps your progress."},
gaJf(){return"A high-energy background. The world around you is moving fast with constant shifts. It\u2019s important to stay alert to external signals and jump into the flow."},
gadh(){return"The period's dynamics are mostly Flow. Resistance is low and the field is cooperative, so steady movement and clean timing are easier to maintain."},
