B.b3k=new A.c(' You\'ve touched upon one of the key differences between [MSA] and traditional astrology. The system of dignities was an intuitive attempt to describe why the same planet manifests with different strengths in different people. However, it was based on the mythological idea that the zodiac signs are "homes" for the planet-gods. [MSA] rejects this metaphor and offers a more logical, structural model. The "strength" or "significance" of a planet is determined not by its position in a sign (a qualitative characteristic), but by its position in the overall architecture of the natal chart (a structural characteristic).',null,null,B.a,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
