B.bdc=new A.c("But if we are all synchronized with the same [Field], why are our lives so different?\n\nLet's return to the orchestra. It has violins, drums, flutes, double basses. When a high note sounds, the violins vibrate. When a powerful bass part plays, the double basses hum, and the flutes are silent.\n\n",null,null,B.a,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
